   van Hove obstruction to the 2D realization is MOOT in this frame.
2. Edge-locking k_F = 5pi/6 is DERIVED (commensuration: filling 5/6 of
   q=6 minibands from the core comb), replacing an assertion.
3. The dilution 1/q is DERIVED from core-supported pairing (weak-V limit).
4. NEW COSTS (explicit, falsifiable): (i) filling must be nu = (q-1)/q --
   pushed down to vortex state-counting, still open; (ii) SHARP TENSION:
   the attractive core piles the locked edge states onto itself (van Hove
